lborsten försvann.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","ggjLRRM2pbv_text":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Christer F.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","ggo0FuGe01V_text":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Tomas W.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","ggrYefE8m-M_text":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"\u003eHittade ett borststrå i hamburgaren förra sommaren och det var nog. Den här känns gedigen och inte något TV-shop-pynt.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","ggreutcPGpi_text":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Rickard B.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","ggymToTtxGn_text":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"\u003eHade farhågor om att den skulle repa gjutjärnet på min Napoleon men det gick fint.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"},"type":"gp-section-619570878011081521"},"gp_section_619570878011147057":{"settings":{"checksum":"08ca0c4971548875bb4ccab50e4f3b9c97074f7a5a3198a86aa5060b71c04bd5_1_1_1_0__1","gg0aF2u8lyT_srcSet_desktop_src":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0947/0174/8548/files/Lagg_till_en_rubrik_3.png","gg0aF2u8lyT_srcSet_mobile_src":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0947/0174/8548/files/Lagg_till_en_rubrik_3.png","gg0aF2u8lyT_srcSet_tablet_src":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0947/0174/8548/files/Lagg_till_en_rubrik_3.png","ggQYsDDjz8q_label":"\u003cp\u003eBeställ Mastern — Fri frakt\u003c/p\u003e","ggcSRSH48Jn_background_desktop_image_src":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0947/0174/8548/files/IMG_4286.jpg","ggcSRSH48Jn_background_tablet_image_src":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0947/0174/8548/files/IMG_4286.jpg","ggxMUIlaaZR_background_mobile_image_src":"https://cdn.shopi